# Values tests read, not switches that decide what runs. Everything runs.
#
# Deliberately sparse: this profile is for a plugin I have not run yet, and
# guessing its capabilities in advance is exactly the mistake the tag model
# exists to prevent. The run decides; anything it turns out genuinely cannot
# do gets declared in expectations.toml afterwards, with a reason.
CONSISTENCY_CHECK=mountpoint -q /mnt/lab-bcachefs-mm && ! findmnt -rno OPTIONS /mnt/lab-bcachefs-mm | grep -qw ro
